<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse, Zurich said it has issued six million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 17.SEP.96-01.SEP.98</p>
<p> PAYDATE	16.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  20,379.82</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE    ISSUE	 PREMIUM	 GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	  20000     2.30 CHF    8.19 PCT	9.82 X</p>
<p> CALL	  21000     1.70 CHF    10.44 PCT     13.28 X</p>
<p> CALL	  22000     1.30 CHF    13.57 PCT     17.36 X</p>
<p> CALL	  23000     1.10 CHF    17.58 PCT     20.52 X</p>
<p> PUT	   20000     2.35 CHF    6.42 PCT	9.61 X</p>
<p> PUT	   21000     3.00 CHF    16.20 PCT     7.52 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
